            "review_title": "Review at Bo Ke Quan",
            "review_text": "Anh Dang\nWorld21 contributions\n0\nWill not come back\nOct 2022\nFood was just ok. Price is a bit high compared to other restaurants in the center. It seems that the staff do not know how to smile. We came in lunch time, there were no other guests then. We said that we are in a bit rush, need to go to airport at 1pm and asked if there was enough time to dine in the food we chose. They said preparing the food is quick so it should be ok. We waited, waited and hurry them. Finally, the food was done preparing at 1pm and had to be packed to take away! Bad service!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 5, 2022",
